From 928d6b7b22e324854b893ad545122d25055c7879 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: STARTAK Wave C Remediation <engineering@startak.local>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 16:50:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Wave C remediation: IRR reliability, engine-boundary
 validation, exposed expense model, quota and a11y

Closes eight defects proven by independent numerical probing:

WC-01 IRR reliability. computeIRR returned a single root for non-conventional
      cash flows with no warning ([-100,300,-250,80] -> 91.07%). Adds
      irr-diagnostics.js: sign-change counting, MIRR, and an explicit
      reliability verdict. computeIRR itself is unchanged.
WC-02 Both valuation engines now publish irrReliability / irrMultipleRootRisk /
      irrSignChanges / mirr, registered in the canonical result contract.
WC-03 Defence in depth. validateEngineInputs ran only inside
      calculateInvestmentCase; direct engine callers bypassed every domain
      check (occupancyRate 5 produced a favourable verdict at 76.4% IRR).
      Validation now runs at the engine boundary as well.
WC-03b PERCENTAGE_FIELDS_0_TO_1 was declared and exported but never enforced --
      loanRate, rentGrowthRate, marketCapRate and others were unchecked. The
      list is now the enforced source, with a separate signed band for growth
      rates so a decline scenario stays legal.
WC-04 leaseStatus is now a validated enumeration. An unknown value previously
      fell through to ?? 0, silently assuming zero vacancy.
WC-05 The insurance note said 'percentage of total annual income' while the
      engine applies the rate to replacement construction value. Corrected in
      both locales and locked to the engine arithmetic by test.
WC-06 managementFeeRate, fixedOpexPerSqm, replacementReservePerSqm,
      opexGrowthRate and an independent building exitCapRate were engine-only
      and unreachable from the UI. Now exposed, with behaviour-preserving
      defaults so no saved deal is silently revalued.
WC-07 localStorage quota exhaustion now raises a typed bilingual
      StorageQuotaExceededError routed to the user, instead of a generic retry
      message that can never succeed.
WC-08 The KPI strip is a labelled aria-live region and warned numeric inputs
      expose aria-invalid (WCAG 4.1.3 and 3.3.1).

Verification: RELEASE_VERIFY_RESULT=PASS, 196/196 regression tests, new
WAVE_C_CHECKS=40 FAILED=0, npm audit 0 findings, production build PASS.
Golden case unchanged: NOI 14,612,760, opex 1,112,040, IRR 0.1444715207802304.
