@@
+- Application-level rate limiting uses `RIAI_RATE_LIMIT_KV` and fails closed when unavailable.
+- Server-side data-discipline enforcement rejects free text in the decision snapshot.
+- Audit trail writes salted subject hashes and snapshot/result hashes to `RIAI_AUDIT_KV` without storing raw payloads.
+
+Wave C environment variables: `RIAI_RATE_LIMIT_KV`, `RIAI_AUDIT_KV`, `RIAI_AUDIT_SUBJECT_SALT`, `RIAI_AI_RATE_PER_MINUTE`, `RIAI_AI_RATE_PER_DAY`, `RIAI_AI_RATE_GLOBAL_PER_DAY`.
+
+Before production use, configure account-level WAF/rate limiting in front of this application-level layer and bind the two KV namespaces.
